{"4088940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Dark Forest Calls", "steam_appid": 4088940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4874490], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THE WORLD FORGOT PSARA. PSARA REMEMBERED YOU.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/93a6c5e423b042795df55b27450452d1.avif?t=1788162740\" width=768 height=1152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psara is still there, beyond a black sea, on an island no map or mind can hold for long. When Elias Whitmore begins dreaming of a dead lighthouse and shores that speak in his own voice, he follows the route leading to the island. But its abandoned streets do not merely feel empty. They feel as though they have been waiting for him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Forest Calls is a story-driven first-person survival horror game that binds light, sound, and memory into a single threat system. Explore fog-shrouded Psara, reconfigure its failing power network, manage scarce resources, and piece together why the island slipped out of the world's memory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">LIGHT IS NOT SAFETY<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/329f756cce8c5a879f17d24fdf66ccc5.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/329f756cce8c5a879f17d24fdf66ccc5.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/329f756cce8c5a879f17d24fdf66ccc5.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness conceals your movement, but it also steals your sight. Restoring a generator can bring doors and machinery back to life and open new routes. Yet every running engine, open flame, and violent sound sends a pulse through the unseen network beneath the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power is both access and invitation. Know when you need the light, and when you need to extinguish it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SILENCE IS A RESOURCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures roaming Psara react to light and sound. Running, firing a weapon, knocking something over, or activating a machine at the wrong moment can reveal your position. Read the space, identify your exits, and manage silence as carefully as ammunition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CHOOSE YOUR FIGHTS<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/6b3aa830aafc62481209cf79d0e82ba3.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/6b3aa830aafc62481209cf79d0e82ba3.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/6b3aa830aafc62481209cf79d0e82ba3.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee weapons and firearms are powerful, but every confrontation has a cost. Ammunition and healing supplies are limited. Choose your target, control the distance, time each attack, and remember that survival sometimes means leaving a fight unfinished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTHING HERE REMEMBERS THE SAME THING<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/f5d59340efa6df3f4610cd1d78d03d40.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/f5d59340efa6df3f4610cd1d78d03d40.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/f5d59340efa6df3f4610cd1d78d03d40.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psara's zombies are not the result of an ordinary outbreak. Their names and identities are gone, leaving old duties, fears, hunger, and fragments of ritual to reshape what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some carry light. Some guard a door or machine without end. Others awaken bodies that should have remained still. Before committing to a fight, learn what the creature in front of you is still trying to repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">READ THE ISLAND PIECE BY PIECE<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/992c5b0ba980a257bfab8ef66cf4039d.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/992c5b0ba980a257bfab8ef66cf4039d.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/992c5b0ba980a257bfab8ef66cf4039d.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the harbor, fog-bound settlements, power facilities, mountain passages, and underground tunnels. Conflicting journals, maintenance reports, clinical records, and voice recordings recount Psara's final days from different points of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No document tells the whole truth. Neither does Elias.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">YOU ONLY HAVE WHAT YOU CAN CARRY<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/a9ba2002fc63ab9e14e7d456585675bd.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/a9ba2002fc63ab9e14e7d456585675bd.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/a9ba2002fc63ab9e14e7d456585675bd.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide limited inventory space between weapons, ammunition, fuel, medical supplies, keys, and objects that matter to the story. Use the power network and the tools you discover to reach sealed areas. Decide what to leave behind without knowing what the next path will demand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ANSWER THE CALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evidence you uncover, the accounts you trust, and the memories you choose to preserve will change the meaning of your final decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psara was forgotten for a reason. Some places should remain forgotten. Some mistakes refuse to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THE WORLD FORGOT PSARA. PSARA REMEMBERED YOU.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/93a6c5e423b042795df55b27450452d1.avif?t=1788162740\" width=768 height=1152 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psara is still there, beyond a black sea, on an island no map or mind can hold for long. When Elias Whitmore begins dreaming of a dead lighthouse and shores that speak in his own voice, he follows the route leading to the island. But its abandoned streets do not merely feel empty. They feel as though they have been waiting for him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Forest Calls is a story-driven first-person survival horror game that binds light, sound, and memory into a single threat system. Explore fog-shrouded Psara, reconfigure its failing power network, manage scarce resources, and piece together why the island slipped out of the world's memory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">LIGHT IS NOT SAFETY<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/329f756cce8c5a879f17d24fdf66ccc5.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/329f756cce8c5a879f17d24fdf66ccc5.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/329f756cce8c5a879f17d24fdf66ccc5.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness conceals your movement, but it also steals your sight. Restoring a generator can bring doors and machinery back to life and open new routes. Yet every running engine, open flame, and violent sound sends a pulse through the unseen network beneath the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power is both access and invitation. Know when you need the light, and when you need to extinguish it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SILENCE IS A RESOURCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures roaming Psara react to light and sound. Running, firing a weapon, knocking something over, or activating a machine at the wrong moment can reveal your position. Read the space, identify your exits, and manage silence as carefully as ammunition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CHOOSE YOUR FIGHTS<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/6b3aa830aafc62481209cf79d0e82ba3.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/6b3aa830aafc62481209cf79d0e82ba3.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/6b3aa830aafc62481209cf79d0e82ba3.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee weapons and firearms are powerful, but every confrontation has a cost. Ammunition and healing supplies are limited. Choose your target, control the distance, time each attack, and remember that survival sometimes means leaving a fight unfinished.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTHING HERE REMEMBERS THE SAME THING<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/f5d59340efa6df3f4610cd1d78d03d40.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/f5d59340efa6df3f4610cd1d78d03d40.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/f5d59340efa6df3f4610cd1d78d03d40.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psara's zombies are not the result of an ordinary outbreak. Their names and identities are gone, leaving old duties, fears, hunger, and fragments of ritual to reshape what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some carry light. Some guard a door or machine without end. Others awaken bodies that should have remained still. Before committing to a fight, learn what the creature in front of you is still trying to repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">READ THE ISLAND PIECE BY PIECE<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/992c5b0ba980a257bfab8ef66cf4039d.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/992c5b0ba980a257bfab8ef66cf4039d.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/992c5b0ba980a257bfab8ef66cf4039d.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the harbor, fog-bound settlements, power facilities, mountain passages, and underground tunnels. Conflicting journals, maintenance reports, clinical records, and voice recordings recount Psara's final days from different points of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No document tells the whole truth. Neither does Elias.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">YOU ONLY HAVE WHAT YOU CAN CARRY<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/a9ba2002fc63ab9e14e7d456585675bd.poster.avif?t=1788162740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/a9ba2002fc63ab9e14e7d456585675bd.webm?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/extras/a9ba2002fc63ab9e14e7d456585675bd.mp4?t=1788162740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide limited inventory space between weapons, ammunition, fuel, medical supplies, keys, and objects that matter to the story. Use the power network and the tools you discover to reach sealed areas. Decide what to leave behind without knowing what the next path will demand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ANSWER THE CALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evidence you uncover, the accounts you trust, and the memories you choose to preserve will change the meaning of your final decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psara was forgotten for a reason. Some places should remain forgotten. Some mistakes refuse to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The world forgot Psara, but the island did not forget you. In this story-driven first-person survival horror, explore its fog-shrouded shores as Elias Whitmore, evade creatures drawn to light and sound, manage scarce supplies, and uncover why Psara vanished from human memory.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/33ac3dbff4b8cd82615a12c4eb0c494871b52caa/header.jpg?t=1788162740", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/9c3dbe0f70f463eaa601b3e93e32cfe2b212a877/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788162740", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088940/9c3dbe0f70f463eaa601b3e93e32cfe2b212a877/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788162740", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</str